      "content": "that makes sense. i'm just a bit paranoid about those hidden defects you mentioned. sometimes it feels like even when a beam looks perfect on the outside, there's something \"wrong\" with it that you just can't see until it's already installed and under load. is there any way to tell if there are these tiny, unseen weak spots or internal flaws that might start causing issues later on?",
